    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the incorrect statement is"
